( Cartridge coordinator: key, terminal flag, pending action, question state.
  Question state: 0 locked, 1 desk discovered, 2 answer delivered.
  Deduction replies remain six bytes. Presentation snapshots are seven. )
|0100
 ;receive #d0 DEO2 #0800 #d2 DEO2
 #0900 #d6 DEO2 #07 #d8 DEO BRK
@receive
 #dd DEI #02 EQU ?conclusion
 #dd DEI #00 NEQ ?done #d4 DEI #01 NEQ ?done
 #0800 LDA #01 LTH ?done #0800 LDA #0a GTH ?done
 #0800 LDA #0a EQU ?question
 #01 LDZ ?show
 #02 LDZ ?done
 #0800 LDA #03 NEQ ?no-key #01 #00 STZ
 @no-key #0800 LDA #02 STZ
 #0800 LDA #0900 STA #02 #dc DEO #01 #d8 DEO !send
@question
 #01 LDZ ?done #02 LDZ ?done #03 LDZ #01 NEQ ?done
 #0a #02 STZ
 ( Explicit returned-page result, not a forwarded input action. )
 #0a01 #0900 STA2 #02 #dc DEO #02 #d8 DEO !send
@conclusion
 #d4 DEI #06 NEQ ?done #02 LDZ #00 EQU ?done
 #0800 LDA #0c GTH ?done #0801 LDA #3f GTH ?done
 #0802 LDA #03 GTH ?done #0803 LDA #03 GTH ?done
 #0804 LDA #03 GTH ?done #0805 LDA #01 GTH ?done
 #02 LDZ #0a NEQ ?ordinary
 #0800 LDA #0b NEQ ?done #0805 LDA ?done
 #0801 LDA #18 AND #18 NEQ ?done
 #02 #03 STZ !copy
@ordinary
 #0800 LDA #0b EQU ?done
 #0805 LDA #00 EQU ?copy
 #02 LDZ #09 NEQ ?done #00 LDZ #00 EQU ?done
 #03 LDZ #02 EQU ?revised-verdict
 #0800 LDA #0a NEQ ?done !accept
@revised-verdict
 #0800 LDA #0c NEQ ?done
@accept
 #01 #01 STZ
@copy
 #03 LDZ ?known-question
 #0801 LDA #18 AND #18 NEQ ?known-question
 #01 #03 STZ
@known-question
 #00 #02 STZ
 #0800 LDA2 #0900 STA2 #0802 LDA2 #0902 STA2 #0804 LDA2 #0904 STA2
 #01 LDZ #0905 STA #03 LDZ #0906 STA
@show
 #01 #dc DEO #07 #d8 DEO
@send
 #01 #d9 DEO #d9 DEI ?done #01 #fe STZ
@done BRK
